# Place at .github/CODEOWNERS. Last matching pattern wins. Use teams, not just individuals.
# Enforce via ruleset: "Require review from Code Owners".

# Default owner for everything
*                       @org/maintainers

# Areas (replace with real paths and owners; 2+ owners per critical area)
/cmd/                   @org/backend
/internal/              @org/backend
/api/                   @org/backend @org/api-reviewers
/migrations/            @org/backend @org/data
/deploy/                @org/platform
/docs/                  @org/maintainers

# Security-sensitive: CI definitions and policy files
/.github/workflows/     @org/security @org/platform
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @org/maintainers
/SECURITY.md            @org/security
